                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2518fd65-5c76-4476-862b-4bc2724adebd",
                                                "sense_id": "0f65de27-6a15-3103-82a1-077d94818348",
                                                "text": "I think that the case also demonstrates some singular aspects of the penis as a narrator of tales, specifically the way in which the erection of a penis falls outside a man's conscious control and therefore threatens a carefully constructed master legal narrative in which bodily self-control graphically represents the self-government contemplated by a democratic legal society."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8e5f8ce7-3a81-454a-9ed7-ea5037e3ad14",
                                                "sense_id": "0f65de27-6a15-3103-82a1-077d94818348",
                                                "text": "There are men who say they cannot bear to show themselves naked before women unless in a state of erection; and indeed through erection the flesh becomes activity, potency, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "27b803b8-0fbb-406e-a208-e88b47794cdc",
                                                "sense_id": "0f65de27-6a15-3103-82a1-077d94818348",
                                                "text": "A marriage was only consummated via erection, penetration, and insemination intra vas."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "37a65240-322a-3cca-87d2-4ff0b5125dc9",
                                        "entry_id": "2b0d8f1b-65bb-3466-876d-e9f00092f3db",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state or quality of being erect from engorgement with blood."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "66a3392b-851d-4125-94bd-ea22a841fc65",
                                                "sense_id": "37a65240-322a-3cca-87d2-4ff0b5125dc9",
                                                "text": "Older men typically require longer periods of time to achieve erection and reach orgasm."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "58292b32-7365-4c23-9698-bf65faa3fc88",
                                                "sense_id": "37a65240-322a-3cca-87d2-4ff0b5125dc9",
                                                "text": "A very rare complication is priapism, where the penis maintains its erection for many hours."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ddf2a88-e293-4b61-bdd2-41279a1d6be2",
                                                "sense_id": "37a65240-322a-3cca-87d2-4ff0b5125dc9",
                                                "text": "[…] but our experienc'd matron very soon, by chafing it with her hands, brought it to swell to that size and erection I had before seen it up to.",
                                                "translation": "Fanny Hill",
                                                "english": "Fanny Hill"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "230d1406-9502-3d57-a7c9-eebb88dd4605",
                                        "entry_id": "2b0d8f1b-65bb-3466-876d-e9f00092f3db",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A penis or clitoris that is erect."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "710305c5-2407-4b35-a43d-4ba035782963",
                                                "sense_id": "230d1406-9502-3d57-a7c9-eebb88dd4605",
                                                "text": "He placed his newspaper on his lap to hide his erection."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "87bdf480-d291-462c-aa63-97f6f844ada1",
                                                "sense_id": "230d1406-9502-3d57-a7c9-eebb88dd4605",
                                                "text": "Nothing is more short-lived than the erection; like the crocus of spring, it is there for a moment, and then it is gone; one moment the penis is small, soft, and insignificant, and then in the next it is hard, rigid, and three and four times its previous size."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "67d58637-58c5-4bc9-9225-037680c23b5c",
                                                "sense_id": "230d1406-9502-3d57-a7c9-eebb88dd4605",
                                                "text": "The surge of hormones during puberty means you might have lots of erections, even when you don't want them—like during school."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d6ff6bdd-19ec-4e0f-816c-f5eabc0774ab",
                                                "sense_id": "230d1406-9502-3d57-a7c9-eebb88dd4605",
                                                "text": "Prem was sure everyone could see his erection through his pants, everyone but Maya, who he had been careful to keep to his side all the time"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "451a2459-b3d6-411e-965f-0ddd6ed6fcf6",
                                                "sense_id": "230d1406-9502-3d57-a7c9-eebb88dd4605",
                                                "text": "He kissed her again, this time with a long, moist kiss that gave him an erection."
